# REC ARM is OPTIONAL and OFF by default: one press of REC records (count-in per metronome mode). First that, then the
# two-step mode (recarm 1): REC arms the tape, PLAY starts it (count-in, then the take); REC again lets it go.
# Playing already: REC records at once. UNDO takes the last take away.
wait 300
expect recarm 0
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
expect nev 0
# DEFAULT (OFF): one press of REC: nothing is armed, the count-in starts at once; REC again lets it go
tap REC
wait 200
expect armed 0
expect counting >0
tap REC
wait 300
expect counting 0
expect recording 0
expect playing 0
# the optional two steps
recarm 1
expect recarm 1
# REC: armed, nothing runs
tap REC
wait 200
expect armed 1
expect recording 0
expect playing 0
# REC again: let go
tap REC
wait 200
expect armed 0
# armed, PLAY: the take starts (count-in)
tap REC
wait 200
expect armed 1
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect armed 0
wait 3500
expect recording 1
key w0 down 90
wait 500
key w0 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 400
expect recording 0
expect events >0
# playing: REC at once, no arming
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 1
tap REC
wait 300
expect armed 0
expect recording 1
tap REC
wait 400
expect recording 0
